      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just the money, it's the feeling that i'm just a burden to everyone. every time i talk to my family i just see the pity in their eyes. it's like i'm stuck in a loop and no matter what i do, the outcome is the same. i'm just tired of the constant struggle and the hopelessness of it all. it feels like the only way to actually stop the pain and the stress is to just... stop everything.",
